                "loc": "NUM.13.1+NUM.13.2+NUM.13.3+NUM.13.4+NUM.13.5+NUM.13.6+NUM.13.7+NUM.13.8+NUM.13.9+NUM.13.10+NUM.13.11+NUM.13.12+NUM.13.13+NUM.13.14+NUM.13.15+NUM.13.16+NUM.13.17+NUM.13.18+NUM.13.19+NUM.13.20+NUM.13.21+NUM.13.22+NUM.13.23+NUM.13.24+NUM.13.25+NUM.13.26+NUM.13.27+NUM.13.28+NUM.13.29+NUM.13.30+NUM.13.31+NUM.13.32+NUM.13.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 13.1-33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nuko duhaguruka i Horebu, turangiza bwa butayu bunini buteye ubwoba, ubwo mwabonaga duca mu nzira ijya mu gihugu cy'imisozi cy'Abamori, uko Uwiteka Imana yacu yadutegetse, tugera i Kadeshi y'i Baruneya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndababwira nti “Mugeze ku gihugu cy'imisozi cy'Abamori, icyo Uwiteka Imana yacu iduha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dore Uwiteka Imana yawe igushyize icyo gihugu imbere, zamuka ugihindūre, uko Uwiteka Imana ya ba sekuruza wanyu yagutegetse. Ntutinye, ntukuke umutima.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mubyumvise mwese mwigira hafi yanjye, murambwira muti “Dutume abatasi batubanzirize badutatire icyo gihugu, bagaruke batubwire inzira dukwiriye kuzamukiramo, n'imidugudu tuzageramo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
